{"bookId": "32055449", "title": "螺丝在拧紧（果麦经典）", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1682494955, "updated": [{"bookId": "32055449", "bookmarkId": "32055449_5_2995-3043", "createTime": 1682494955, "range": "2995-3043", "markText": "“哦，我并不敢自命唯一，”我居然还能笑得出来，“哎，别管这些了。我的另一个学生，是明天回来吗？”", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 5}, {"bookId": "32055449", "bookmarkId": "32055449_4_6335-6396", "createTime": 1682477566, "range": "6335-6396", "markText": "在这座乡间庄园里，还有一位厨娘、一名女仆、一个挤奶的女工、一匹年老的矮种马、一个老马夫和一个老花匠，他们也都是些可敬之人。", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 4}, {"bookId": "32055449", "bookmarkId": "32055449_4_6049-6092", "createTime": 1682477495, "range": "6049-6092", "markText": "在这座乡间庄园，还有很多人帮忙，不过，当然即将成为家庭教师的年轻小姐应该享有最高权威。", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 4}, {"bookId": "32055449", "bookmarkId": "32055449_4_5478-5561", "createTime": 1682477132, "range": "5478-5561", "markText": "在他城里的寓所中，有一个偌大房间摆满了他在各地旅游时带回的纪念品和一箱箱的纪念物、收藏品。可是，他希望她立刻前往的地方，却是他乡下的宅邸，一座在埃塞克斯郡的古老庄园。", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 4}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "chapterUid": 5, "chapterIdx": 5}, {"title": "引子", "chapterUid": 4, "chapterIdx": 4}], "book": {"bookId": "32055449", "version": 465552104, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/449/32055449/s_32055449.jpg", "title": "螺丝在拧紧（果麦经典）", "author": "[美]亨利·詹姆斯", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "KSD9uAM|My~VRkRk={RkkW", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#241532"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#28113a"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#2c0a42"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#382b48"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#3b2850"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#40235b"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#4f4162"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#523e6c"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#563a76"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#5e3089"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#695884"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#705199"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#665b79"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#876cb4"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#7e7591"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#846fa9"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#988faa"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#9a8cb7"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#9d8ac3"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#a383db"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#b6a4df"}, {"key": "7/10", "hex": "#b9a1ec"}, {"key": "7/12", "hex": "#bd9dfa"}, {"key": "8/4", "hex": "#cbc4df"}, {"key": "8/6", "hex": "#cdc1ee"}, {"key": "8/12", "hex": "#d7b7ff"}, {"key": "9/2", "hex": "#e4e1ec"}, {"key": "9/12", "hex": "#f2d0ff"}, {"key": "1/100", "hex": "#9d8ac3"}, {"key": "2/100", "hex": "#b6a4df"}, {"key": "3/100", "hex": "#ffffff"}, {"key": "4/100", "hex": "#EAE5F3"}, {"key": "5/100", "hex": "#EAE5F3"}, {"key": "6/100", "hex": "#0C0027"}], "dominate_color": {"hex": "#332741", "hsv": [268.2765656772024, 40.17652245103596, 25.46828245751352]}, "custom_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookalphacover/449/32055449/s_32055449.jpg", "custom_rec_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookreccover/449/32055449/s_32055449.jpg", "colorsPure": ["#a383db", "#bd9dfa"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7IacgBwCK", "review": {"bookVersion": 196549264, "bookId": "32055449", "content": "作者用一种很不寻常的写作手法，通常作者的描述是让读者可以相信的，而这本小说恰恰相反。开始的时候让读者依旧认为第一人称是类似上帝视角的作者，描述的事实是可信的，并且用了大量心理描写，拉近与读者的距离。然而，随着越来越多不可思议的描写，反复强调的心理状态，让读者渐渐的走到了作者的对立面，开始怀疑故事的真实性，也就怀疑这个第一人称，女家庭教师。其实从头到尾，都是在讲述家庭女教师的故事，借用他人的视角，来反向描写女家庭教师的疯狂。", "type": 4, "star": 60, "reviewId": "17408780_7IacgBwCK", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1683911023, "isFinish": 1, "flag": 0, "newRatingLevel": 2, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "32055449", "format": "epub", "version": 465552104, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/449/32055449/s_32055449.jpg", "title": "螺丝在拧紧（果麦经典）", "author": "[美]亨利·詹姆斯", "translator": "邹海仑", "payType": 1048577}, "bookFinderSuccessCount": 0, "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4T